
{% doc %}
  @prompt
    CREATE A NEW MOBILE-FIRST PREMIUM FITNESS GALLERY SECTION.
    
    This section must be designed specifically for mobile devices first.
    
    The layout should feel identical to premium product galleries used by Apple, Nike and high-end fitness coaching brands.
    
    The entire section must fit perfectly inside a mobile screen width without horizontal overflow, clipping or cut-off content.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    SECTION LAYOUT
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    The section contains exactly four parts:
    
    1. Main image gallery
    2. Thumbnail navigation row with arrows
    3. Verified reviews row
    4. Premium headline
    
    No additional content should exist.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    MAIN IMAGE GALLERY
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Create a horizontal image gallery supporting up to 25 images.
    
    Requirements:
    
    • Mobile-first layout.
    • One primary image visible at a time.
    • Approximately 10-15% of the next image should remain visible on the right side.
    • Approximately 10-15% of the previous image should remain visible on the left side.
    • This creates a premium swipeable gallery effect.
    
    Image requirements:
    
    • Border radius: 20px
    • Width: 82-85% of viewport width
    • Height: Auto
    • Maintain original aspect ratio
    • No image cropping
    • No stretching
    • No distortion
    • Images must remain fully visible.
    
    The gallery must use:
    
    • CSS scroll snap
    • Momentum scrolling on iOS
    • Smooth swipe gestures
    
    The gallery should behave exactly like a premium mobile app carousel.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    THUMBNAIL NAVIGATION
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Directly below the gallery create a compact navigation row.
    
    Layout:
    
    [ Left Arrow ] [ Thumbnails 1–25 (scrollable) ] [ Right Arrow ]
    
    Requirements:
    
    • Entire row fits inside viewport width.
    • No horizontal overflow.
    • No clipping.
    • No wrapping to second line.
    
    Thumbnail specifications:
    
    • Size: 52px × 52px
    • Border radius: 12px
    • Equal spacing between thumbnails.
    • Active thumbnail slightly larger.
    • Active thumbnail receives subtle orange border.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    ARROWS
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Arrow buttons should sit on the far left and far right of the thumbnail strip.
    
    Requirements:
    
    • Diameter: 44px
    • Circular shape
    • Semi transparent dark background
    • Thin white border
    • White arrow icons
    • Orange hover state
    • Vertically aligned with thumbnail row
    
    Do not place arrows:
    
    • Above the gallery
    • Inside the image
    • Floating independently
    • Between sections
    
    The arrows should frame the thumbnails exactly like premium automotive configurators and Apple product galleries.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    VERIFIED REVIEWS
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Below the thumbnail row add:
    
    ★★★★★
    27,000+ VERIFIED REVIEWS
    
    Requirements:
    
    • Orange stars
    • White uppercase typography
    • Increased letter spacing
    • Center aligned
    • Compact spacing
    • Strong premium feel
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    HEADLINE
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Below the reviews add:
    
    Build The Body You've
    Always Wanted In 90 Days.
    
    Requirements:
    
    • Large premium typography
    • Center aligned
    • Tight line height
    • Strong hierarchy
    • White text
    • Highlight "90 Days" using #FF6200
    
    Typography inspiration:
    
    • Nike
    • Apple
    • WHOOP
    • Gymshark
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    MOBILE VALIDATION
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Before completing the section verify:
    
    • No element exceeds viewport width.
    • No text gets cut off.
    • No arrows overflow outside screen.
    • No thumbnails overflow outside screen.
    • No horizontal page scrolling exists.
    • Entire section looks perfect on iPhone devices.
    • Entire section works correctly between 320px and 430px screen widths.
    
    The section should feel intentionally designed for mobile rather than adapted from desktop.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    COLOR SYSTEM
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Background:
    #050505
    
    Text:
    #FFFFFF
    
    Accent:
    #FF6200
    
    Use only these colors throughout the section.
    
    Final experience:
    
    Apple product gallery
    +
    Nike campaign page
    +
    Premium online fitness coaching funnel., Reduce the height of images by 30%     , REFINE THE FITNESS GALLERY FOR A MORE PREMIUM AND COMPACT MOBILE EXPERIENCE.
    
    Do not redesign the section.
    
    Do not change the carousel structure.
    
    Do not change the thumbnail row.
    
    Do not change the verified reviews section.
    
    Do not change the headline.
    
    Only refine image proportions, borders and overall visual density.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    REDUCE IMAGE HEIGHT
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    The current images are too tall and dominate the screen.
    
    The gallery currently feels closer to an Instagram story viewer rather than a premium fitness showcase.
    
    Reduce image height by approximately 30-40%.
    
    Target aspect ratio:
    
    4:5
    
    Avoid:
    
    • Full-screen portrait images
    • Story-style layouts
    • Extremely tall cards
    
    The gallery should feel compact and premium.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    SHOW MULTIPLE IMAGES
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    The active image should remain dominant.
    
    However, part of the next and previous image should remain visible.
    
    Target visibility:
    
    • Main image: approximately 70%
    • Next image visible: approximately 15%
    • Previous image visible: approximately 15%
    
    This creates a premium gallery experience and communicates that more content exists.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    ADD PREMIUM IMAGE BORDER
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Add a premium border around the image group similar to premium fitness landing pages.
    
    Requirements:
    
    • Thin border
    • Soft white color
    • Low opacity
    • Rounded corners (20-24px)
    • Border wraps entire image container
    
    The border should create structure without feeling heavy.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    IMAGE SPACING
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Reduce spacing between images.
    
    Target gap:
    
    8px to 10px.
    
    Images should feel connected as one premium gallery rather than separate cards.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    SECTION HEIGHT
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Reduce overall section height significantly.
    
    The image gallery should no longer dominate the page.
    
    Users should begin seeing:
    
    • Thumbnail row
    • Verified reviews
    • Headline
    
    without excessive scrolling.
    
    The goal is visual efficiency and premium density.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    REFERENCE FEEL
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    The gallery should feel similar to:
    
    • Premium fitness coaching funnels
    • Nike campaign galleries
    • Apple product showcases
    
    The experience should feel clean, structured and intentional.
    
    Less Instagram Story.
    
    More premium product showcase.     
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-fitness-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top }}px 0 {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom }}px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-fitness-gallery__container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 16px;
    margin: 0 16px 20px;
  }

  .ai-fitness-gallery__main-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    overflow-x: auto;
    overflow-y: hidden;
    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    scrollbar-width: none;
    -ms-overflow-style: none;
  }

  .ai-fitness-gallery__main-{{ ai_gen_id }}::-webkit-scrollbar {
    display: none;
  }

  .ai-fitness-gallery__track-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 0 4%;
  }

  .ai-fitness-gallery__slide-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 92%;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    scroll-snap-align: center;
  }

  .ai-fitness-gallery__image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    max-height: 75vh;
    object-fit: contain;
    border-radius: 28px;
    display: block;
    background: #050505;
  }

  .ai-fitness-gallery__nav-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 0 16px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .ai-fitness-gallery__arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    cursor: pointer;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-fitness-gallery__arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
  }

  .ai-fitness-gallery__arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    stroke: #ffffff;
    stroke-width: 2;
    fill: none;
  }

  .ai-fitness-gallery__thumbs-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    overflow-y: hidden;
    scrollbar-width: none;
    -ms-overflow-style: none;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    max-width: calc(100% - 100px);
  }

  .ai-fitness-gallery__thumbs-{{ ai_gen_id }}::-webkit-scrollbar {
    display: none;
  }

  .ai-fitness-gallery__thumb-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 52px;
    height: 52px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    cursor: pointer;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    border: 2px solid transparent;
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  .ai-fitness-gallery__thumb-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active {
    transform: scale(1.1);
    border-color: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .ai-fitness-gallery__thumb-{{ ai_gen_id }} img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 10px;
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-fitness-gallery__reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    padding: 0 16px;
  }

  .ai-fitness-gallery__stars-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
    font-size: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
  }

  .ai-fitness-gallery__review-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .ai-fitness-gallery__headline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }

  .ai-fitness-gallery__headline-{{ ai_gen_id }} h2 {
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.headline_size }}px;
    line-height: 1.1;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-family: 'Inter', san-serif;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* lurvox-hero-cta-v3 */
  .ai-fitness-gallery__cta-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: stretch;
    gap: 10px;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 100%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    padding: 16px 16px 10px;
  }

  .ai-fitness-gallery__cta-primary-{{ ai_gen_id }},
  .ai-fitness-gallery__cta-ghost-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1px;
    flex: 1 1 180px;
    min-width: 0;
    max-width: 100%;
    min-height: 52px;
    padding: 9px 18px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.15;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .ai-fitness-gallery__cta-primary-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: #140a00;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ff8a3d 0%, {{ block.settings.accent_color }} 100%);
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
    box-shadow: 0 10px 26px rgba(255, 98, 0, 0.32);
  }

  .ai-fitness-gallery__cta-primary-{{ ai_gen_id }} small {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 650;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .ai-fitness-gallery__cta-ghost-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28);
    flex-direction: row;
    min-height: 52px;
  }

  /* lurvox-hero-cta-v6 — secondary is a text link, not a second button */
  .ai-fitness-gallery__cta-{{ ai_gen_id }}[data-lx-hero-cta-single] {
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: stretch;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .ai-fitness-gallery__cta-{{ ai_gen_id }}[data-lx-hero-cta-single] .ai-fitness-gallery__cta-primary-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: none;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-fitness-gallery__cta-{{ ai_gen_id }}[data-lx-hero-cta-single] .ai-fitness-gallery__cta-ghost-{{ ai_gen_id }},
  .ai-fitness-gallery__cta-ghost-{{ ai_gen_id }}.lx-hero-cta-text {
    flex: none;
    width: auto;
    align-self: center;
    min-height: 0;
    padding: 4px 6px;
    background: transparent !important;
    border: none !important;
    box-shadow: none !important;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72) !important;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    font-weight: 650;
    text-decoration: underline !important;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 430px) {
    .ai-fitness-gallery__thumb-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
    }

    .ai-fitness-gallery__arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
    }

    .ai-fitness-gallery__headline-{{ ai_gen_id }} h2 {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.headline_size | times: 0.8 }}px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 360px) {
    .ai-fitness-gallery__thumb-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
    }

    .ai-fitness-gallery__nav-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: 6px;
    }

    .ai-fitness-gallery__thumbs-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: 6px;
    }
  }

  /* lurvox-mobile-fitness-gallery-v2 */
  .ai-fitness-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 100%;
    min-width: 0;
    width: 100%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow-x: clip;
  }

  .ai-fitness-gallery__container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 100%;
    min-width: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-fitness-gallery__main-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 100%;
    min-width: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden !important;
    scroll-snap-type: none;
    scroll-behavior: auto;
    /* Not a nested scroller — vertical swipe scrolls the page */
    touch-action: pan-y;
  }

  .ai-fitness-gallery__slide-{{ ai_gen_id }},
  .ai-fitness-gallery__image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    touch-action: pan-y;
    -webkit-user-drag: none;
    user-select: none;
  }

  .ai-fitness-gallery__slide-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    scroll-snap-stop: always;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-fitness-gallery__container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 10px;
      margin: 0 12px 16px;
    }

    .ai-fitness-gallery__track-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 0;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .ai-fitness-gallery__slide-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 100%;
    }

    .ai-fitness-gallery__image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      border-radius: 14px;
      max-height: 62vh;
    }

    .ai-fitness-gallery__thumbs-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      max-width: calc(100% - 88px);
      gap: 6px;
    }

    .ai-fitness-gallery__thumb-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
    }

    .ai-fitness-gallery__cta-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 12px 12px 8px;
    }

    .ai-fitness-gallery__cta-primary-{{ ai_gen_id }},
    .ai-fitness-gallery__cta-ghost-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex: 1 1 calc(50% - 8px);
      min-width: 0;
      padding: 8px 10px;
      font-size: 13px;
      min-height: 48px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 360px) {
    .ai-fitness-gallery__cta-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .ai-fitness-gallery__cta-primary-{{ ai_gen_id }},
    .ai-fitness-gallery__cta-ghost-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 100%;
      flex-basis: auto;
    }
  }
  /* /lurvox-mobile-fitness-gallery-v2 */
{% endstyle %}

<!-- AUTO_SCROLL_MARKER_1784966547853 -->
<fitness-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-fitness-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-fitness-gallery__container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-fitness-gallery__main-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-gallery-main>
      <div class="ai-fitness-gallery__track-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% assign fitness_slide_index = 0 %}
        {% for i in (1..25) %}
          {% assign image_key = 'image_' | append: i %}
          {% assign image = block.settings[image_key] %}
          {% if image != blank %}
            {% assign fitness_slide_index = fitness_slide_index | plus: 1 %}
            <div class="ai-fitness-gallery__slide-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-slide="{{ fitness_slide_index }}">
              <img
                src="{{ image | image_url: width: 800 }}"
                alt="{{ image.alt | escape }}"
                loading="lazy"
                width="{{ image.width }}"
                height="{{ image.height }}"
                class="ai-fitness-gallery__image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
              >
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
        {% if fitness_slide_index == 0 %}
          <div class="ai-fitness-gallery__slide-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-slide="1">
            <div style="width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 4/5; background: #1a1a1a; border-radius: 16px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;">
              {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="ai-fitness-gallery__nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <button class="ai-fitness-gallery__arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-arrow="prev" aria-label="Previous image">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
        <polyline points="15 18 9 12 15 6"></polyline>
      </svg>
    </button>

    <div class="ai-fitness-gallery__thumbs-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% assign fitness_thumb_index = 0 %}
      {% for i in (1..25) %}
        {% assign image_key = 'image_' | append: i %}
        {% assign image = block.settings[image_key] %}
        {% if image != blank %}
          {% assign fitness_thumb_index = fitness_thumb_index | plus: 1 %}
          <div class="ai-fitness-gallery__thumb-{{ ai_gen_id }} {% if fitness_thumb_index == 1 %}active{% endif %}" data-thumb="{{ fitness_thumb_index }}">
            <img
              src="{{ image | image_url: width: 100 }}"
              alt="{{ image.alt | escape }}"
              loading="lazy"
              width="100"
              height="100"
            >
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
      {% if fitness_thumb_index == 0 %}
        <div class="ai-fitness-gallery__thumb-{{ ai_gen_id }} active" data-thumb="1">
          <div style="width: 100%; height: 100%; background: #1a1a1a; border-radius: 10px;"></div>
        </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    <button class="ai-fitness-gallery__arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-arrow="next" aria-label="Next image">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
        <polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"></polyline>
      </svg>
    </button>
  </div>

  <div class="ai-fitness-gallery__reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-fitness-gallery__stars-{{ ai_gen_id }}">★★★★★</div>
    <div class="ai-fitness-gallery__review-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.review_text }}</div>
  </div>

  <div class="ai-fitness-gallery__headline-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
